fa</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Suarez</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Prueba de ELISA indirecta para la deteccion de anticuerpos IgM para el diagnostico de leptospirosis humana.</article-title><source>Rev Peru Med Exp Salud Publica</source><volume>19</volume><fpage>24</fpage><lpage>27</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pntd.0000213-Faine1"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Faine</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><year>1982</year><source>Guidelines for the Control of Leptospirosis</source><publisher-loc>Geneva</publisher-loc><publisher-name>World Health Organization</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="pntd.0000213-Ribot1"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ribot</surname><given-names>EM</given-names></name><name><surname>Fair</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Gautom</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Cameron</surname><given-names>DN</given-names></name><name><surname>Hunter</surname><given-names>SB</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Standardization of pulsed-field gel electrophoresis protocols for the subtyping of <italic>Escherichia coli</italic> O157:H7, <italic>Salmonella</italic>, and <italic>Shigella</italic> for PulseNet.</article-title><source>Foodborne Pathog Dis</source><volume>3</volume><fpage>59</fpage><lpage>67</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16602980</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pntd.0000213-Carrico1"><label>11</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Carrico</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Pinto</surname><given-names>FR</given-names></name><name><surname>Simas</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Nun